### What remains unknown

The public documentation reviewed does not establish:

- payment method;
- payment authorization;
- payment approval threshold;
- bank integration;
- payment scheduling;
- payment batching;
- treasury controls;
- settlement confirmation;
- reconciliation;
- failed-payment handling.

Therefore the safe reconstruction ends at:

```text
CREATE VOUCHER
      ↓
MAKE PAYMENT
```

rather than inventing a payment-processing architecture.

